        "nom_orig": "Ginko",
        "texte_orig": "If[SP]I[SP]hadn't[SP]met[SP]you[SP]guys,[SP]maybe[SP]I[SP]would've\nlived[SP]in[SP]fear[SP]of[SP]a[SP]false[SP]memory...",
